@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Temporary External Review
actor Sponsor as HOD
actor "External Reviewer" as Reviewer
participant UI
participant "External Access Service" as Access
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Review Service" as Review
participant "Version Service" as Version
participant Audit
HOD -> UI : create review assignment/invite
UI -> Access : provision scoped time-bound grant
Access -> Audit : sponsor, scope, expiry
Reviewer -> UI : authenticate/open assignment
UI -> Auth : validate grant, time, scope, action
Auth --> UI : allowed context
UI -> Review : fetch assigned evidence only
Review --> UI : review package
Reviewer -> UI : submit findings/permitted uploads
UI -> Version : append feedback/evidence versions
UI -> Review : submit assignment
Review -> Audit : record completion
Access -> Access : expire/revoke grant
@enduml
